        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity mix, summer 2018</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity mix, summer 2018
The operational electricity consumption (heating, hot water, ventilation, lighting, and auxiliaries) is modelled by a specific electricity mix used for the operation of the electricity consumption of Switzerland in summer 2018.;
UUID: 90820dd6-cb49-35a3-ac20-426b74f5fdac
This dataset includes the shares of different technologies of the electricity mix used for the electricity consumption of Switzerland.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Average technology
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Statistics 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_90820dd6-cb49-35a3-ac20-426b74f5fdac.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
